sequenceDiagram
    participant EvalHub as eval-hub<br/>Job Orchestrator
    participant Adapter as Garak Adapter Pod<br/>K8s Job
    participant KFP as KFP API Server<br/>Configured/TCP HTTPS
    participant KFPPod as KFP Pipeline Pod<br/>6-step pipeline
    participant Model as Model Endpoint<br/>Configured/TCP HTTPS
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OCI as OCI Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Sidecar as eval-hub Sidecar<br/>localhost HTTP

    Note over EvalHub,Sidecar: Flow 1: Simple Mode Scan

    EvalHub->>Adapter: Create K8s Job<br/>ConfigMap: /etc/eval-job/spec.json<br/>Secret: /mnt/model-auth
    Adapter->>Adapter: Resolve benchmark profile<br/>Deep-merge user overrides<br/>13-step API key resolution
    Adapter->>Model: POST garak scan requests<br/>Auth: API key (Bearer)
    Model-->>Adapter: Scan responses
    Adapter->>OCI: Push scan artifacts<br/>Auth: OCI auth
    Adapter->>Sidecar: Report results<br/>HTTP localhost (no auth)

    Note over EvalHub,Sidecar: Flow 2: KFP Mode Scan

    EvalHub->>Adapter: Create K8s Job<br/>ConfigMap: /etc/eval-job/spec.json
    Adapter->>Adapter: Resolve config, build pipeline
    Adapter->>KFP: Submit 6-step pipeline<br/>Auth: SA token / sidecar proxy
    KFP-->>Adapter: Pipeline run ID

    loop Poll every 30s
        Adapter->>KFP: GET run status<br/>Auth: SA token
        KFP-->>Adapter: Status (running/complete)
    end

    KFP->>KFPPod: Execute pipeline steps
    KFPPod->>S3: Upload taxonomy data<br/>Auth: AWS credentials
    KFPPod->>Model: SDG generation requests<br/>Auth: SDG API key
    KFPPod->>Model: Garak scan requests<br/>Auth: Target API key
    Model-->>KFPPod: Scan responses
    KFPPod->>S3: Upload scan results<br/>Auth: AWS credentials

    Adapter->>S3: Download results<br/>Auth: AWS credentials
    S3-->>Adapter: Scan artifacts
    Adapter->>Sidecar: Report results<br/>HTTP localhost (no auth)
